// field order matches entire.io's live-path JSON (finalizeCommitsResponse appends
// from_cache last). The GitHub-coupling fields take fixed envelope constants —
// entire-api is a native git store with no GitHub-App install or history-backfill
// model — EXCEPT session_branch_exists, which is derived from the repo's checkpoint
