// TestParseSession_FloorsNegativeTokenCounts pins the ingest boundary against
// nonsense counts. A negative count is not a smaller number, and it fails
// quietly rather than loudly: Estimate multiplies it by a positive rate, so a
// negative input_tokens SUBTRACTS from the estimated cost, and the same value
// would land in the stored totals feeding repo aggregates and cross-cell
